OL,3,A'Silence is complicity' - top
OL,4,Afootballer hits out over Cameroon
OL,5,Afemicides
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe government has also raised concern
OL,8,Fabout the rise in attacks. At least 50
OL,9,Fwomen have been killed between January
OL,10,Fand April this year, compared to 77
OL,11,Flast year, according to official
OL,12,Ffigures.
OL,14,FIn the latest case on Tuesday, a
OL,15,F44-year-old woman was killed in a hotel
OL,16,Froom in the capital, Yaounde. She was
OL,17,Fallegedly stabbed to death by a
OL,18,F22-year-old who was later arrested.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
